<!--
    What the DualDesk flavour makes of the shared help screen and of the application's own name.

    The code base in :bVNC belongs to the upstream project and is shared with its other
    applications, so it keeps pointing at the upstream forum, store listing and support address.
    DualDesk has none of those: it is built and published from its own repository, and a surface
    it has no target for is left out of the help screen rather than pointing somewhere else.
-->
